WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:05,940
Humph, you always said before that being alone as a single man or woman can easily affect your reputation.

2
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:09,330
I think it's right. We have nothing to do with each other.

3
00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:11,350
Should keep distance

4
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:14,650
I used to keep a distance from you because I loved gossiping with others.

5
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:16,550
Can you please stop being so fussy?

6
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:18,150
We are not a couple

7
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:20,250
This kind of intimacy is inappropriate

8
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:21,950
I've always been disciplined in my form

9
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:27,410
In fact, I have always had a crush on you.

10
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:30,010
After getting along for a long time, feelings will naturally develop

11
00:00:30,010 --> 00:00:34,120
We can definitely try to develop into a couple

12
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,950
You made a mistake

13
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:37,850
In the past, I only had a general crush on you

14
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:39,450
Not to mention persistent pursuit

15
00:00:39,450 --> 00:00:40,550
on my terms

16
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:42,750
It’s not difficult to find a suitable companion

17
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:47,090
You don’t have to overestimate your weight in my heart

18
00:00:47,090 --> 00:00:48,690
Even if you tried before, you would always obey me.

19
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:49,890
All my heart is mine

20
00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:51,480
They all say this
